    <h1 class="display-lg reveal reveal-delay-1" style="color:#fff;max-width:820px;">Volksbank PHD: brand integration after acquiring Bankverein Werther</h1>
    <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:720px;margin-top:1rem;">An acquired brand, without the feeling of a takeover.</p>
